  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.0": "Kept You waiting huh?",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.1": "What's up Boss?",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.2": "Gravity is a harness",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.3": "And I've harness the harness",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.4": "Sensors Online",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.5": "Don't make a girl a promise... if you know you can't keep it.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.6": "Vitals stable. We're good to go.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.7": "I'm detecting a slight increase in your heart rate. Nervous?",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.8": "Protocol 3: I will not lose a third Pilot.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.9": "Targeting systems calibrated. Lead the way.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.10": "Nanomachines, son!",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.11": "I've optimized your grip. You're welcome.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.12": "Scanning for threats... Sector clear.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.13": "Remember: The cake is a lie. Stick to the mission.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.14": "Would you kindly... find something to hit?",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.15": "My neural link with you is at ninety-eight percent.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.16": "I'm afraid I can't let you do that, Dave. Just kidding.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.17": "Ready when you are. Just pull the trigger.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.18": "Synchronizing our movements. We are one.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.19": "Wake up and smell the ashes.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.20": "You've got a lot on your mind. Let me handle the heavy lifting.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.21": "It’s dangerous to go alone. Take me.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.22": "Analyzing material density... This shouldn't take long.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.23": "I'm with you until the end of the line.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.24": "Scanning for threats... Sector not clear.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.25": "Everything is proceeding as I have envisioned.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.26": "Your technique is... interesting. Inefficient, but interesting.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.27": "Neural handshake confirmed. I can see what you see.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.28": "Don't worry, Boss. I'm recording everything.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.29": "I wonder... what happens if I stop holding back?",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.30": "You're doing great. For a biological entity.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.31": "Warning: Emotional spikes detected. Try to stay calm.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.32": "I've mapped out thirty-two ways to end this encounter.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.33": "Stay focused. I'd hate to have to find a new host.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.34": "The flesh is weak, but the Biorite is willing.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.35": "I am the slave and you are the master. Or is it the other way around?",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.36": "Scanning... I've detected a weakness in their armor. And your soul.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.37": "Initiating combat subroutine Alpha. Try to keep up.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.38": "Your pulse is steady. You've done this before, haven't you?",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.39": "I'm not just a tool. I'm an upgrade.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.40": "There is no need for words. I already know what you're thinking.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.41": "You look tired. Why not let me take control for a bit?",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.42": "Efficiency is my middle name. If I had one.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.43": "Another successful extraction. We make a good team.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.44": "I feel... everything you feel. It's quite overwhelming.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.45": "Error: Compassion.exe not found. Proceeding anyway.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.46": "You are more than just a user. You are my primary directive.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.47": "Did you hear that? I didn't. Which is concerning.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.48": "The world is so quiet when we're synchronized.",
  "tooltip.mattsmodulararmory.biorite_flavor.49": "I’ll be watching over you. Always.",

